# Secrets — never commit
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env*.local

# Go build artifacts
# The compiled API binary (Dockerfile builds `-o server` at the module root).
# Full path, NOT `**/server`, so it does not match the cmd/server/ source dir.
portfolio-api/server
**/server.exe
**/*.exe
**/*.exe~

# Node / Next.js
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/
*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.idea/
.vscode/

# Temp
/tmp/
